WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.400
-Earlier today we sent our pal
Emma Chamberlain

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.968
down to the 30 Rock plaza
to give out

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.767
some free coffee to New Yorkers.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:07.968
But in order to get a free cup,
they had to give her

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:10.200
something in return --
their deepest secrets.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.767
This is "Barista Confessions."
Check it out.

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:14.534
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:17.901
-♪ Barista confessions ♪

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:19.868
-So, are you willing to tell me
a secret

00:00:19.868 --> 00:00:22.000
in exchange for a coffee?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.634
-I think for a coffee, I will.

00:00:23.634 --> 00:00:24.734
-Okay. Let's hear it.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.767
-My grandparents,
my mom-mom and pop-pop,

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:28.667
they met in prison.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:30.634
-Badass. Badass.

00:00:30.634 --> 00:00:32.334
-Thanks so much, girl.
-Thank you so much.

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:35.334
-Not many people know
but I accidentally set

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:38.901
just a random stranger, a
woman's, hair on fire at a bar.

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.300
Yeah. I was doing a trick
with a matchbook.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.868
-Okay.
-And I guess she had

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:45.467
a lot of hair spray.
-Totally flammable.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:47.767
-She went up.
-You really deserve a coffee.

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:50.400
-Thanks.
-So I listened to the advice of

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.968
a witch on TikTok.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:55.667
Now I have the name of a guy
I used to hook up

00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:59.767
with two years ago in a jar full
of maple syrup under my bed.

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:00.934
-Obsessed.

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:02.567
-He was supposed to be
"stuck on me."

00:01:02.567 --> 00:01:04.534
-I have a really gorgeous aunt.

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:06.868
But in middle school I took
her photo

00:01:06.868 --> 00:01:08.868
and all of her personal
information

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:11.901
and I made multiple Jdate
profiles with it.

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:14.100
So not one but two men
named Simon

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.367
have invited her
to live in Israel.

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.834
-So you're gonna get
one of these.

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:19.567
-Thank you.
-I hooked up with

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:21.334
my ex-best friend's sister.

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:23.167
-So does your best friend know?

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:24.901
-God, I don't think so.

00:01:24.901 --> 00:01:26.200
-Now they do.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.767
-Yeah, I was, like, walking home
from work one day

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.901
and I was like three blocks away
from home.

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:33.367
-Yeah.
-And all of a sudden it hits me.

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:35.834
And I'm like, "Oh, no!"
-I know. I've been there.

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:38.534
-"I have to go."
And, like, I pooped my pants.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:40.400
-This won't help you with
the pooping problem,

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.133
but I love this story.
That was good.

